&lt;li data-start=&quot;2149&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2151&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;Structured incident response experience and clear communication under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
